1
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:09,640
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:12,710
=Episode 25=

3
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:15,720
(The powerless can only bow and obey.)

4
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:24,240
Consort Rong.

5
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:25,920
You dared defy me,

6
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,680
and now the Empress Dowager.

7
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:28,880
Do you admit your fault?

8
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:34,040
I...

9
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:37,760
Do not.

10
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:41,520
Even now, you won't repent?

11
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:43,160
Guards.

12
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:45,120
Send Consort Rong back
to the Jinghe Palace.

13
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:46,360
Without my decree,

14
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:47,720
she may not leave!

15
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:04,720
So this is the palace
everyone dreams of.

16
00:01:05,240 --> 00:01:06,840
Magnificent and splendid,

17
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:10,760
a place of honor and glory.

18
00:01:12,160 --> 00:01:13,880
But beneath all this splendor,

19
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:18,400
how many bones lie buried?

20
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:21,200
No matter how high one rises,

21
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:23,840
in the end,

22
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:26,360
we are all just pitiful souls.

23
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:29,760
Fate is never ours.

24
00:01:35,480 --> 00:01:36,600
Your Majesty.

25
00:01:37,320 --> 00:01:39,200
Do you remember Zhaoyi Shen?

26
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:43,880
She was lowborn, like me.

27
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,800
Desperate for a better life,

28
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:48,920
she clung to Noble Consort Hui.

29
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:50,440
And in the end,

30
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,080
she died in the cold palace.

31
00:01:56,080 --> 00:01:58,840
And Noble Consort Hui,
the Empress Dowager's niece,

32
00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:01,240
came from a distinguished family.

33
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:05,760
Yet for the glory
of the men in her family,

34
00:02:06,320 --> 00:02:07,920
she entered the palace as a consort,

35
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:09,720
trapped for the rest of her life.

36
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:11,200
And in the end,

37
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:15,080
she was forced to take poison and die.

38
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:16,800
Consort Rong.

39
00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:18,040
please mind your words.

40
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:19,640
And Concubine Rou,

41
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:22,640
a beauty unmatched,

42
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:26,200
yet her beauty brought death upon her.

43
00:02:27,720 --> 00:02:29,800
Noble Consort Hui preyed on her desires,

44
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:32,040
and made her use her beauty

45
00:02:32,760 --> 00:02:34,040
to lure the imperial heir.

46
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,800
If I hadn't stepped in,

47
00:02:37,480 --> 00:02:38,920
she would have met her end.

48
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:42,360
Concubine Qi fought for favor

49
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:45,640
and caused her to lose her child.

50
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:49,360
She was schemed against by everyone,

51
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:52,360
her life like grass,

52
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:54,480
a mere pawn in their games.

53
00:02:55,640 --> 00:02:56,960
And those consorts

54
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:59,400
who've lost their minds
in the cold palace...

55
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,640
When they were young,

56
00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:05,080
they were also loved by their families,

57
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:09,120
cherished like precious jewels.

58
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:12,120
Yet this place,

59
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:16,280
for all its splendor,

60
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:19,560
is cold and merciless.

61
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:21,560
One by one,

62
00:03:22,320 --> 00:03:23,160
it drives everyone who enters

63
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:25,840
to become less than human,

64
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:28,200
like ghosts.

65
00:03:30,920 --> 00:03:31,800
Your Majesty.

66
00:03:32,920 --> 00:03:34,520
We struggle just to be born,

67
00:03:34,760 --> 00:03:36,520
and life itself is hard enough.

68
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:38,280
But even so,

69
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:41,520
we still fight to protect those we love.

70
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,240
But what about you?

71
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,400
For the sake of so-called

72
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:47,320
everlasting imperial rule

73
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:48,600
and political balance,

74
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:52,200
you'd send your own daughter away
for a marriage alliance!

75
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:57,200
You may be a worthy ruler,

76
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:00,920
but not a worthy father.

77
00:04:01,040 --> 00:04:01,840
Enough!

78
00:04:04,760 --> 00:04:05,880
You've lost your mind.

79
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:07,800
You repeatedly speak out of turn!

80
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,640
If you dare say another word,

81
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:10,880
I will strip you

82
00:04:11,160 --> 00:04:12,560
of your title

83
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,640
and make you a commoner.

84
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:15,480
My title?

85
00:04:19,520 --> 00:04:21,600
Wealth and glory,

86
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:23,720
power and status...

87
00:04:25,280 --> 00:04:26,320
I've never

88
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:28,680
cared for any of those things!

89
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:32,880
You've truly gone mad!

90
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:33,320
Yes!

91
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:34,320
I've gone mad!

92
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:35,560
I've lost my mind!

93
00:04:38,320 --> 00:04:39,440
I once

94
00:04:40,640 --> 00:04:43,600
desired nothing more than
an ordinary life as a palace consort.

95
00:04:44,520 --> 00:04:46,320
I didn't mind being low-ranked.

96
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:48,280
Nor did I mind

97
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,880
receiving little favor.

98
00:04:51,280 --> 00:04:53,520
I only wanted to keep my Lingxi

99
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:55,760
and live a quiet life.

100
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:58,120
But Concubine Qi wouldn't allow it.

101
00:04:58,640 --> 00:05:00,600
She used poison to silence my Lingxi.

102
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:02,520
Noble Consort Hui did evil

103
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:04,120
and killed her to cover it up.

104
00:05:04,280 --> 00:05:06,720
What did my Lingxi ever do wrong?

105
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:12,480
I climbed a path lined with blades,

106
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:15,440
not for wealth or glory,

107
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:17,400
not for rank or status.

108
00:05:17,960 --> 00:05:19,760
All I wanted was justice

109
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:22,720
for my daughter.

110
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:25,880
Your Majesty.

111
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:28,160
I exposed Concubine Qi

112
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:30,560
for poisoning Lingxi and silencing her,

113
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,920
and for harming the royal heirs.

114
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:35,200
Yet you protected and indulged her.

115
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:37,160
I proved to you

116
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,440
that she poisoned the late Empress,

117
00:05:39,880 --> 00:05:42,240
the woman you loved most.

118
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:44,440
And still you let her off,

119
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:45,760
allowing her to keep doing evil,

120
00:05:45,760 --> 00:05:47,040
with a heart like a snake's.

121
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:50,200
Those women who died unjustly,

122
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:52,440
did they deserve to die for nothing?

123
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:53,840
And my Lingxi,

124
00:05:55,280 --> 00:05:57,920
did she deserve to be silenced?

125
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:00,880
This harem

126
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:02,800
is mine to rule.

127
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:05,320
My rewards and punishments are my own.

128
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:07,400
Your own?

129
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:11,440
Your judgment

130
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:13,600
means indulging

131
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:15,680
the wicked to roam free,

132
00:06:16,440 --> 00:06:18,200
letting the innocent die,

133
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:20,160
and the good

134
00:06:20,760 --> 00:06:22,280
suffer endless injustice.

135
00:06:23,640 --> 00:06:24,720
Your judgment

136
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:28,200
means sacrificing
your own flesh and blood

137
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,520
to secure your throne forever.

138
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:35,920
You're mad.

139
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:37,640
You've truly gone mad!

140
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:39,440
By my decree.

141
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:41,520
Consort Rong

142
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:43,240
has defied imperial authority,

143
00:06:43,640 --> 00:06:44,680
cursed the royal heirs,

144
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:45,960
and slandered the imperial harem!

145
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:47,600
Effective immediately,

146
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:49,640
her title is stripped.

147
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:50,840
She's reduced to a commoner,

148
00:06:51,320 --> 00:06:52,240
and thrown into the cold palace!

149
00:07:46,440 --> 00:07:47,360
Sister Rong.

150
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:49,640
Have you settled in here?

151
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,400
Oh, I forgot.

152
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:55,000
You've been here before.

153
00:07:55,320 --> 00:07:56,720
This place must feel familiar.

154
00:07:58,400 --> 00:08:00,320
We were like sisters once.

155
00:08:00,880 --> 00:08:02,480
Now that you're in the cold palace,

156
00:08:02,960 --> 00:08:04,160
you probably don't know
the news outside.

157
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:07,720
So I came to share some good news.

158
00:08:08,760 --> 00:08:10,720
Jinxuan's wedding procession

159
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:13,120
sets off today.

160
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:22,440
I told you on purpose that

161
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:25,960
Jinxuan was the one who caught
Noble Consort Hui in the act.

162
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:27,720
I knew it.

163
00:08:28,080 --> 00:08:30,200
All your talk of virtue was an act.

164
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:31,240
In the end,

165
00:08:32,040 --> 00:08:33,920
you still sent Jinxuan away.

166
00:08:34,880 --> 00:08:35,760
Hypocrite.

167
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:37,880
You lost.

168
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:40,120
You clawed your way out
of the cold palace,

169
00:08:40,680 --> 00:08:42,080
crushing anyone who stood in your way,

170
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:43,240
no matter who they were.

171
00:08:44,280 --> 00:08:45,640
But when it came to me,

172
00:08:46,040 --> 00:08:48,600
even after you exposed me
for harming the royal heirs

173
00:08:48,760 --> 00:08:50,000
and plotting against the late Empress,

174
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:53,560
I'm still standing here
without a scratch.

175
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:55,920
I knew exactly

176
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:58,640
you'd meddle in state affairs.

177
00:08:59,640 --> 00:09:00,640
The moment you did,

178
00:09:01,520 --> 00:09:02,920
His Majesty would cast you off.

179
00:09:05,520 --> 00:09:06,080
Oh...

180
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:06,800
Look.

181
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:09,560
My daughter is still here.

182
00:09:10,760 --> 00:09:12,000
But yours?

183
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:17,080
Your daughter is dead.

184
00:09:17,800 --> 00:09:19,920
And you've been thrown into
the cold palace.

185
00:09:20,520 --> 00:09:22,160
After all that struggle,

186
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:23,840
you're back where you started.

187
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,640
You brought this on yourself.

188
00:09:30,480 --> 00:09:31,520
Dear sister,

189
00:09:32,160 --> 00:09:33,520
let me teach you something.

190
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:35,560
In this harem,

191
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:37,960
offending His Majesty

192
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:39,400
and defying his orders,

193
00:09:39,880 --> 00:09:42,000
that's the real capital crime.

194
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:45,880
Justice and morality?

195
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:48,360
They're just words to fool the naive.

196
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:50,960
In this world,

197
00:09:51,160 --> 00:09:52,720
it's all about winners and losers.

198
00:09:53,800 --> 00:09:55,640
There's no such thing as good rewarded
and evil punished.

199
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:59,120
With power and position,

200
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:01,280
you can do as you please.

201
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:03,400
The powerless

202
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:05,760
can only bow and obey.

203
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:07,920
Understand?

204
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,760
I once believed

205
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:21,520
that under these heavens,

206
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:23,480
justice would prevail,

207
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:26,040
that under the sun and moon,

208
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:28,640
fairness would endure.

209
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:31,080
But now I understand.

210
00:10:31,800 --> 00:10:32,640
Justice

211
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:34,520
can't beat power.

212
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:36,920
Fairness

213
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:40,040
can't win hearts.

214
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:44,080
But looking back on my journey,

215
00:10:45,680 --> 00:10:46,680
I have no regrets.

216
00:10:50,680 --> 00:10:53,040
A mere ant thinks it can defy heaven.

217
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,440
How ridiculous.

218
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:29,200
(Envoys from Beijie)

219
00:11:29,943 --> 00:11:31,080
(By the Mandate of Heaven)

220
00:11:35,160 --> 00:11:36,960
By the Mandate of Heaven,

221
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:38,680
His Majesty decrees.

222
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:40,720
My daughter Jinxuan,

223
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:42,360
gentle and upright,

224
00:11:42,640 --> 00:11:44,080
modest in conduct,

225
00:11:44,560 --> 00:11:47,600
is hereby titled Princess Yongning.

226
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:50,040
The Beijie tribe has sent envoys
to seek her hand,

227
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:52,240
wishing to bind our nations.

228
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:54,160
To secure our borders

229
00:11:54,400 --> 00:11:56,200
and spare the people war,

230
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:58,320
Princess Yongning

231
00:11:58,400 --> 00:12:00,440
shall wed the Beijie Khan.

232
00:12:00,680 --> 00:12:02,480
Upon entering his household,

233
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:03,920
she shall uphold wifely duties,

234
00:12:04,120 --> 00:12:05,440
embrace those afar,

235
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:08,000
and never dishonor the kindness
of her parents.

236
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,760
Let this be obeyed.

237
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:11,560
So decreed.

238
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:31,440
On behalf of the Khan of Beijie,

239
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:33,080
I thank Your Majesty

240
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:34,160
for your wisdom and generosity.

241
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:35,760
By accepting the princess's hand,

242
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:36,960
our two nations

243
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:38,360
shall be bound in marriage.

244
00:12:39,960 --> 00:12:41,800
Young as she is,
the princess knows honor.

245
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:43,520
To secure our borders

246
00:12:43,640 --> 00:12:45,040
and spare the people war,

247
00:12:45,520 --> 00:12:46,440
she bravely accepts
this distant marriage.

248
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:48,560
She is a model of feminine virtue,

249
00:12:48,920 --> 00:12:49,960
and a credit to the royal house.

250
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:51,120
I,

251
00:12:51,280 --> 00:12:52,520
on behalf of all the people,

252
00:12:53,160 --> 00:12:54,760
thank the princess
for her great kindness.

253
00:12:56,600 --> 00:12:58,840
Farewell, Princess.

254
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:03,040
Princess.

255
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:04,400
Please come with me to Beijie.

256
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:06,240
We've slaughtered cattle and sheep,

257
00:13:06,400 --> 00:13:07,000
and the Khan

258
00:13:07,160 --> 00:13:08,760
eagerly awaits your arrival.

259
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:14,880
Stop.

260
00:13:22,960 --> 00:13:24,120
You came seeking a marriage alliance.

261
00:13:24,560 --> 00:13:27,160
I've entrusted my beloved daughter
to you.

262
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:29,040
I've shown my sincerity.

263
00:13:30,160 --> 00:13:31,120
Now, where is yours?

264
00:13:33,537 --> 00:13:38,177
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

265
00:13:38,547 --> 00:13:43,027
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

266
00:13:43,457 --> 00:13:47,737
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

267
00:13:48,177 --> 00:13:52,657
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

268
00:13:53,097 --> 00:13:57,417
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

269
00:13:57,997 --> 00:14:02,457
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

270
00:14:02,797 --> 00:14:07,257
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

271
00:14:07,677 --> 00:14:12,177
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

272
00:14:12,467 --> 00:14:16,937
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

273
00:14:17,517 --> 00:14:20,600
♪Let the stars and sea♪

274
00:14:20,600 --> 00:14:22,120
(Changsheng Gate)

275
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:26,427
♪Wait for your return♪
